{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00945","headline":"横吹曲辞 後出塞五首 一 · 杜甫","name":"横吹曲辞 後出塞五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"男儿生世间，及壮当封侯。\n战伐有功业，焉能守旧丘。\n召募赴蓟门，军动不可留。\n千金买马鞭，百金装刀头。\n闾里送我行，亲戚拥道周。\n斑白居上列，酒酣进庶羞。\n少年别有赠，含笑看吴钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}